# TypeScript & Linting

## TypeScript Strictness
- **Do not use** `@ts-nocheck`. 
- If typing errors exist, fix the typings properly.

## Lint Rules
- Lint rules and TypeScript strictness must always be respected.
- Never bypass or ignore linting errors without proper justification.
